      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "White DK yarn, approx. 23 g. Black DK yarn, approx. 9 g for the hat. Orange DK yarn, approx. 4 g for the nose. 3.5 mm crochet hook. Tapestry needle. Craft scissors. Soft measuring tape. Polyester stuffing. Small buttons or beads for the eyes and front buttons, or embroider them on."
